2 CONT  http://members.tripod.com/minata/bps_7_dec.html
2 CONT  http://books.google.se/books?id=6MEd4AA_S8UC&pg=PA357&lpg=PA357&dq=wendela+skytte+poet&source=bl&ots=JzWIgzj3Z5&sig=Ll00iJMGl1Vpv6gDzDO9r85XQlA&hl=sv&sa=X&oi=book_result&resnum=5&ct=result
2 CONT  A. L. Stjerneld (anonym), Gripsholmgalleriet (Stockholm 1833)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Litterature
2 CONT  Wilhelmina Stålberg, Anteckningar om svenska qvinnor (Notes on Swedish women)
2 CONT  Women Latin Poets, Jane Stevenson
