1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please do not add to Bure family.   it cannot be proven she or any of the family are related to the Bure family according to curator for Dordi, mother of Catharina Eriksdotter Sursill.
2 CONT
2 CONT //////////
2 CONT
2 CONT There seems to be some confusion here. The reasoning above goes that:
2 CONT
2 CONT This profile does not belong to family '''Bure''' because it does not belong to family '''Sursill'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I rest assured that the reasoning behind that is flawless. 
2 CONT
2 CONT However, Geni links Anna to both [https://www.geni.com/path/Anna-Westzynthia+is+related+to+Erik?from=6000000041301423569&to=4214300184020064927 Erik Ångerman] and [https://www.geni.com/path/Anna-Westzynthia+is+related+to+Gamle-Olo
2 CONC f?from=6000000041301423569&to=5328189268700111491 Gamle Olof]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT By this token, she should belong to both the families, but I shall remain clueless as ever. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Seuraava muokkaaja kommentoi että tämä henkilö kuuluu Bure perheeseen äitinsä Niurenian puolelta jokatapauksessa. Aika jolloin on katsottu oudosti vain miesperillisiä, tms on jäänyt menneeseen.
