2 CONT * Biographical Lexicon of Eminent Swedish Men , Volume 2, 1836
2 CONT * Georg Gezelius, Attempt at a Biographical Lexicon of Famous and Learned Men ... , volume 4, 1787
2 CONT * Daniel Behmer , Swedish Biographical Dictionary , Swedish Biographical Dictionary-ID : 18415 , read online.
2 CONT * Adelsvapen Geneologies 
