1 NAME Olaus /Jonasson/
2 GIVN Olaus
2 SURN Jonasson
2 _MARNM Jonæ Hosselius
2 NICK Olof Jonasson
2 NICK Hasselius
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1604
2 ADDR
