1 NAME Anders Pettersson //
2 GIVN Anders Pettersson
2 SURN Bergius
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 STAE Varsinais-Suomi
3 CTRY Finland
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 APR 1661
2 ADDR
3 CITY Turku
3 STAE Varsinais-Suomi
3 CTRY Finland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 SEP 1724
